---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Setup Model Hint">
  <h1>Setup Model Hint <span class="docs-tag">Setup</span></h1>
  <p class="docs-lead">Inline code badge used inside prose to highlight config keys, model names, and file paths. Renders with a monospace font and a subtle background pill.</p>

  <h2>Preview</h2>
  <div class="docs-preview">
    
    <p>
      Add a single block to <code class="setup-model-hint__code">~/.claude/settings.json</code> and
      every <code class="setup-model-hint__code">claude</code> run picks up the new endpoint.
      Point the model at <code class="setup-model-hint__code">manifest/auto</code> to let Manifest
      pick for you.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>HTML</h2>
  <div class="docs-code"><pre>&lt;p&gt;
  Add a block to
  &lt;code class="setup-model-hint__code"&gt;~/.claude/settings.json&lt;/code&gt;
  and every &lt;code class="setup-model-hint__code"&gt;claude&lt;/code&gt; run picks
  up the new endpoint.
&lt;/p&gt;</pre></div>

  <h2>Class reference</h2>
  <table class="docs-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>.setup-model-hint__code</td><td><span class="docs-tag docs-tag--element">element</span></td><td style="color:var(--docs-text-muted)">Inline code badge; Fira Code font, small size, warm background pill</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</DocsLayout>
